# Stack: frontend HTTP client

Package choices only. Client/hook layout and toast UX live in `frontend-http-api`. Attach with `frontend-http-api`.

| Concern | Choice | Notes / fallback |
|---------|--------|------------------|
| Remote server state | TanStack Query (react-query) | Invalidate on relevant mutations; avoid ad-hoc fetch caches |
| External data schemas | valibot | Schemas in `types/`; parse `unknown` at the boundary |
